# PolyForm Small Business License 1.0.0 — with irrevocable carve-outs

Copyright (c) 2026 Cherokee AI Federation

This software is licensed under the **PolyForm Small Business License 1.0.0**.
Full text: https://polyformproject.org/licenses/small-business/1.0.0/

In short: free for individuals, for nonprofits, and for businesses under $5M annual revenue.
A commercial license is required above that threshold.

## Irrevocable carve-outs

The following grants are made in addition to the PolyForm terms. **They are irrevocable and
survive any future change to this license, including a change to a more restrictive one.**

1. **Academic and research use.** Universities, schools, and research laboratories may use this
   software free of charge for teaching and research, without revenue limitation.

2. **Tribal sovereign entities.** Federally recognized tribes, tribal enterprises, and tribal
   governments may use this software free of charge, **regardless of revenue**.

If a future version of this project carries a different license, these two grants continue to
apply to that version. They cannot be withdrawn.

## Why these carve-outs exist

This project comes out of a federation whose purpose is sovereign intelligence for the people who
build it, and for communities that are under-served by the current shape of the industry. A
license that charged a tribal government for governance tooling would contradict the reason the
tooling exists.

Ratified by Council vote, 2026-04-20.
